          "success": {
            "en": "“बालको वदति,” you say, “the boy speaks,” and the breath-statue's mist, which had been hanging in the air in a nervous little cloud, settles in a line across the hall, like a word written in air, and is gone. “रामोऽस्ति,” she says. “Rāma is. And someone is listening.” She breathes in, for the first time in a thousand years.",
